  // CENSUS-FLEET-TIMEOUT-1 (agent_issues 100166, 1000488): qnfo-ops /fleet probes every worker (up to 6 s each, then a retry) and lists the account, so it answered in 3.7 to 7.3 s and at times past
  // the 12 s default of a hop (binding-census@cf: 12000 ms at 18:40, 20:20, 20:40 and 21:20Z on 2026-10-28, which also left deploy-coherence with "census rows to compare: none"). The census answering
